           &< \frac{4}{n^2} \cdot \left( 1 + \ldots + \frac{n-1}{2} \right) + \frac{4}{n^2} \cdot \left( \frac{n-1}{2} + \ldots + 1 \right) \\
           &= \frac{4}{n^2} \cdot 2 \cdot \frac{1}{2} \cdot \frac{n-1}{2} \cdot \frac{n+1}{2} = \frac{n^2 - 1}{n^2},
